pe":"math","value":"2fv_0"},{"type":"text","value":"。另一组电池的储能功率为"},{"type":"math","value":"U_0I_c"},{"type":"text","value":"。轮换维持行驶时，平均储能功率至少应等于用电功率。"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U_0(\\mathit{E}-U_0)}{2R}\\geq2fv_0."},{"type":"text","value":"固定 T 时，左侧在"},{"type":"math","value":"U_0=\\mathit{E}/2"},{"type":"text","value":"达到最大值"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathit{E}^2/(8R)"},{"type":"text","value":"。最大周期对应等号，需"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathit{E}=4\\sqrt{Rfv_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，代入（1）得到结果。"}]}}]}
